      "evidence": "Initial code resumed with raw this after static QInputDialog/QFileDialog calls. The library used QMenu menu(this) on the stack during exec. Main manageMacros had QPointer, but these nested methods did not.",
      "trigger": "While a nested input is active, accept it and destroy the manager in the same queued callback before getText returns; or destroy owner during the parented stack menu exec.",
